WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.064
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind manage workbooks.

00:00:05.867 --> 00:00:11.200
Backup: is an extra saved copy of important work. Folder: groups related files.

00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:17.820
File extension: can show a file type. Cloud storage: can save files on a remote

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:21.292
service. Restore: returns an earlier saved copy when possible.

00:00:22.117 --> 00:00:27.298
In a small group, draw or safely examine pictures of backup, folder and file

00:00:27.298 --> 00:00:30.629
extension. Explain one real-life use for each in Ghana.
